278
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,259
Only by holding on to military power

279
00:18:18,140 --> 00:18:19,640
can one have a backing.

280
00:18:20,519 --> 00:18:21,779
If you have nothing in your hands,

281
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:22,720
it's like

282
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:25,559
