293
00:19:02,339 --> 00:19:03,799
the Yu's Army.

294
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:05,900
But our guns

295
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:07,259
are for shooting enemies,

296
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:09,140
not for

297
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:10,900
serving politicians.

298
00:19:35,519 --> 00:19:36,319
What?

299
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:38,460
The singing and dancing inside

300
00:19:38,759 --> 00:19:40,220
don't suit your taste?

301
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,559
You want to come out to enjoy the cold wind?

302
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:49,259
Just now inside,

303
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,319
Jiang Xueting was pushing hard.

304
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:56,000
Do you also want to push the Yu's Army

305
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,440
to a dead end?

306
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:06,019
I'm Mrs. Jiang.

307
00:20:06,619 --> 00:20:08,400
I don't help my husband,

308
00:20:08,759 --> 00:20:10,160
am I supposed to help others?

309
00:20:20,259 --> 00:20:22,119
You help Jiang Xueting rise step by step,

310
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,980
isn't it just to deal with Yue,

311
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:26,759
and deal with the Yu family?

312
00:20:33,619 --> 00:20:34,619
You're right.

313
00:20:35,299 --> 00:20:36,119
Li Bojin,

314
00:20:36,759 --> 00:20:38,160
listen carefully.

315
00:20:38,859 --> 00:20:40,539
My goal is simple:

316
00:20:41,359 --> 00:20:42,779
to take down Yu Changxuan

317
00:20:42,779 --> 00:20:44,079
by any means necessary.

318
00:20:44,579 --> 00:20:46,759
I want to see him fall,

319
00:20:47,579 --> 00:20:48,000
to see him

320
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:50,259
kneel before me,

321
00:20:50,759 --> 00:20:52,019
like a beaten dog.

322
00:20:59,079 --> 00:21:00,000
Tao Ziyi,

323
00:21:02,079 --> 00:21:03,039
you can hate,

324
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:05,680
but you can't do things

325
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:07,000
against your conscience for revenge.

326
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:09,759
I don't care who you are married to,

327
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:10,940
nor do I care

328
00:21:10,940 --> 00:21:12,019
how harsh your words are.

329
00:21:12,759 --> 00:21:14,119
I always believe

330
00:21:16,579 --> 00:21:18,240
the Tao Ziyi I know,

331
00:21:19,579 --> 00:21:21,079
although capricious,

332
00:21:22,799 --> 00:21:24,259
is kind-hearted

333
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,259
and naive.

334
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:38,859
Don't let yourself

335
00:21:40,500 --> 00:21:41,359
turn into someone

336
00:21:41,359 --> 00:21:42,539
you yourself would hate.

337
00:22:40,980 --> 00:22:43,039
Miss Ye, you're awake.

338
00:22:48,460 --> 00:22:49,980
Thank you, Dr. Xie.

339
00:22:50,579 --> 00:22:52,039
You stayed with me all night again.

340
00:22:52,259 --> 00:22:53,039
It's okay.

341
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:54,539
I should do it.

342
00:22:55,619 --> 00:22:56,440
By the way,

343
00:22:57,299 --> 00:22:58,200
I haven't seen

344
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:59,960
Yu'er for a long time.

345
00:23:00,519 --> 00:23:01,740
Is he okay?

346
00:23:02,619 --> 00:23:03,920
He is fine.

347
00:23:04,579 --> 00:23:07,259
But he always wants to see his mother.

348
00:23:11,660 --> 00:23:12,680
When you get better

349
00:23:12,980 --> 00:23:14,299
and recover,

350
00:23:14,519 --> 00:23:16,079
you can see him soon.

351
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,400
Dr. Xie,

352
00:23:26,940 --> 00:23:27,759
do you think

353
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:30,940
Nala will come back

354
00:23:32,259 --> 00:23:33,859
after she left home?

355
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,200
Miss Ye,

356
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,660
have you read A Doll's House?

357
00:23:39,259 --> 00:23:41,420
When I was in the girls' school,

358
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:44,740
I always loved reading Ibsen's plays.

359
00:23:47,579 --> 00:23:48,799
To be honest,

360
00:23:50,039 --> 00:23:51,160
with your knowledge

361
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:53,299
and eloquence,

362
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:54,700
you are definitely not

363
00:23:54,700 --> 00:23:56,680
a woman who relies on a man.

364
00:23:57,740 --> 00:23:58,680
Why are you

365
00:24:01,039 --> 00:24:02,240
trapped here?

366
00:24:09,500 --> 00:24:10,359
Dr. Xie,

367
00:24:11,579 --> 00:24:12,640
although

368
00:24:13,220 --> 00:24:15,500
you are invited by Jiang Xueting,

369
00:24:16,980 --> 00:24:18,299
I can see that

370
00:24:19,180 --> 00:24:20,900
you are not the same kind of person as him.

371
00:24:23,500 --> 00:24:24,400
Thank you

372
00:24:25,180 --> 00:24:26,859
for taking care of me this year.

373
00:24:27,759 --> 00:24:29,079
I can feel

374
00:24:29,359 --> 00:24:30,940
that you really care about

375
00:24:31,019 --> 00:24:32,480
me and Xiaoyu.

376
00:24:38,259 --> 00:24:39,160
Now,

377
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,519
there's one thing

378
00:24:43,019 --> 00:24:43,960
only you, Doctor Xie,

379
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,259
can help me with.

380
00:24:46,859 --> 00:24:47,740
Miss Ye,

381
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:50,039
what do you mean by this?

382
00:24:58,680 --> 00:24:59,500
Watch out!

383
00:25:02,980 --> 00:25:03,680
Miss Ye,

384
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:04,259
get up.

385
00:25:04,259 --> 00:25:05,299
What are you doing?

386
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:09,900
Please help me.

387
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:14,359
This letter,

388
00:25:15,579 --> 00:25:16,279
please deliver it

389
00:25:16,279 --> 00:25:17,940
to the residence of Nan Huaiyu.

390
00:25:19,940 --> 00:25:21,440
I'm the wife of

391
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,519
Deputy Commander Yu Changxuan.

392
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,740
As long as he sees this letter,

393
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:29,240
he will come to save me.

394
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,799
I know this is

395
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:35,539
a very dangerous task.

396
00:25:36,940 --> 00:25:38,119
If you are unwilling to do it,

397
00:25:38,119 --> 00:25:39,420
I won't force you.

398
00:25:40,819 --> 00:25:42,619
You can destroy this letter

399
00:25:43,259 --> 00:25:44,740
and pretend you never saw it.

400
00:26:16,259 --> 00:26:17,039
Thank you.

401
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:21,980
Thank you.

402
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,180
My Lord,

403
00:26:31,660 --> 00:26:33,079
here are today's letters.

404
00:26:33,579 --> 00:26:34,019
Some of them

405
00:26:34,019 --> 00:26:35,519
are urgent messages from Nanjing.

406
00:27:40,460 --> 00:27:41,279
Uncle.

407
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,099
Changxuan.

408
00:27:42,539 --> 00:27:43,539
Don't worry too much

409
00:27:43,539 --> 00:27:45,079
about the pressure from Nanjing.

410
00:27:45,259 --> 00:27:46,279
My father sent a telegram

411
00:27:46,279 --> 00:27:47,299
from Washington.

412
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:49,039
saying that Secretary of State Stimson

413
00:27:49,039 --> 00:27:50,680
is monitoring the situation in China.

414
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:51,660
The U.S.

415
00:27:51,660 --> 00:27:53,259
doesn't want Nanjing

416
00:27:53,259 --> 00:27:55,039
to centralize power through force,

417
00:27:55,039 --> 00:27:56,619
which could lead to a new civil war.

418
00:27:56,740 --> 00:27:57,519
But

419
00:27:58,180 --> 00:27:59,799
Nanjing seems

420
00:27:59,799 --> 00:28:01,420
very determined this time.

421
00:28:01,759 --> 00:28:02,759
I'm afraid

422
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:04,920
this won't end easily.

423
00:28:05,539 --> 00:28:07,400
Their most pressing issues now

424
00:28:07,500 --> 00:28:09,180
are lack of money and guns.

425
00:28:09,740 --> 00:28:10,819
My uncle holds

426
00:28:10,819 --> 00:28:11,819
some of the most desired

427
00:28:11,819 --> 00:28:12,920
military orders in Nanjing.

428
00:28:13,359 --> 00:28:14,220
If they insist on

429
00:28:14,220 --> 00:28:15,900
cutting the size of the Yu's army,

430
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,400
he will put pressure on the Nanjing government

431
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:18,619
in terms of loans

432
00:28:18,619 --> 00:28:20,180
and military deliveries.

433
00:28:20,779 --> 00:28:21,720
The Nanjing government

434
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:23,119
will make a choice

435
00:28:23,119 --> 00:28:24,599
after weighing the pros and cons.

436
00:29:29,519 --> 00:29:30,160
Mr. Jin,

437
00:29:30,460 --> 00:29:31,759
we're running out of ammunition.

438
00:29:32,759 --> 00:29:33,460
Hold the line!

439
00:29:33,859 --> 00:29:34,720
This batch of penicillin

440
00:29:35,019 --> 00:29:36,400
is for the people in the epidemic area.

441
00:29:36,819 --> 00:29:37,920
It must not fall into their hands.

442
00:29:38,099 --> 00:29:38,579
Yes, sir.

443
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,519
Come on, you brats.

444
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,059
Retreat, quickly.

445
00:30:21,759 --> 00:30:23,220
All Western medicine?

446
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:26,980
I'm patrolling nearby.

447
00:30:27,779 --> 00:30:28,579
I didn't expect

448
00:30:29,619 --> 00:30:30,819
to run into an old friend.

449
00:30:36,339 --> 00:30:37,180
Jin,

450
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:39,900
do you have anything to tell me?

451
00:30:45,180 --> 00:30:46,079
These medicines

452
00:30:47,539 --> 00:30:49,180
are for the border of the Soviet area.

453
00:30:50,180 --> 00:30:51,559
There's an outbreak of typhoid,

454
00:30:53,799 --> 00:30:55,180
and many civilians died.

455
00:30:58,460 --> 00:30:59,259
So,

456
00:31:02,519 --> 00:31:03,759
you're a communist?

457
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:05,440
Yes.

458
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:08,660
I've joined the Communist Party.

459
00:31:13,519 --> 00:31:14,779
I should have thought of it.

460
00:31:16,759 --> 00:31:18,460
I've read your diary,

461
00:31:19,940 --> 00:31:20,660
and I've seen

462
00:31:20,660 --> 00:31:21,960
your vision back then.

463
00:31:23,259 --> 00:31:25,079
The seed was planted long ago.

464
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,819
Back in Tokyo, Mingxuan and I

465
00:31:30,420 --> 00:31:31,720
often attended speeches

466
00:31:32,579 --> 00:31:34,339
by democratic revolution groups.

467
00:31:35,759 --> 00:31:36,660
After returning to China,

468
00:31:38,660 --> 00:31:40,079
I traveled between Shenyang and other places

469
00:31:40,660 --> 00:31:41,960
for book clubs.

470
00:31:43,339 --> 00:31:44,180
But

471
00:31:45,339 --> 00:31:47,160
after meeting Mr. Liang Wenbo,

472
00:31:48,019 --> 00:31:49,019
I realized that

473
00:31:49,759 --> 00:31:51,579
the Communist Party

474
00:31:53,019 --> 00:31:54,019
is the best way to save the country.

475
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,319
Four years ago,

476
00:31:57,039 --> 00:31:59,579
Wenbo introduced me to the Party,

477
00:32:01,220 --> 00:32:02,519
and I officially joined.

478
00:32:04,259 --> 00:32:04,960
Changxuan,

479
00:32:07,039 --> 00:32:08,259
I want to thank you.

480
00:32:09,759 --> 00:32:11,019
Because of the Xiangxi Hotel,

481
00:32:12,039 --> 00:32:13,400
I've helped many Party members

482
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:17,500
and their families.

483
00:32:19,140 --> 00:32:20,200
Otherwise,

484
00:32:20,599 --> 00:32:21,759
many would have been

485
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:24,700
rewarded by the Nanjing government.

486
00:32:29,519 --> 00:32:30,279
Jin,

487
00:32:32,779 --> 00:32:34,420
your choice is risky,

488
00:32:36,579 --> 00:32:37,920
but it's honorable.

489
00:32:40,319 --> 00:32:42,079
I know your aspirations.

490
00:32:44,180 --> 00:32:45,220
I won't stop you,

491
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:48,660
only support you.

492
00:32:54,259 --> 00:32:55,460
Fill their car with gas,

493
00:32:55,819 --> 00:32:56,779
and get another car

494
00:32:57,319 --> 00:32:58,220
for them to lead the way.

495
00:32:58,700 --> 00:32:59,240
Yes, sir.

496
00:33:01,500 --> 00:33:01,980
Come.

497
00:33:06,519 --> 00:33:07,319
Let's go.

498
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:10,640
Take care.

499
00:33:14,220 --> 00:33:14,920
Go.

500
00:33:52,039 --> 00:33:52,839
My Lord,

501
00:33:54,019 --> 00:33:55,220
why don't you tell him

502
00:33:55,759 --> 00:33:56,619
that you come here

503
00:33:56,619 --> 00:33:57,420
to save him?

504
00:34:00,599 --> 00:34:01,759
It's not necessary.

505
00:34:29,300 --> 00:34:30,039
Brother,

506
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,599
I'm here to see you again.

507
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,519
I overcame opposition

508
00:34:37,679 --> 00:34:39,760
and led the Yu's Army to change its allegiance

509
00:34:40,860 --> 00:34:42,039
to Nanjing.

510
00:34:44,039 --> 00:34:45,760
I thought I did the right thing.

511
00:34:48,539 --> 00:34:49,940
I thought without civil war,

512
00:34:52,139 --> 00:34:53,219
we could give the people

513
00:34:53,219 --> 00:34:54,440
a peaceful life.

514
00:34:55,139 --> 00:34:57,059
But at the Nanjing government meeting,

515
00:34:58,260 --> 00:35:00,340
I heard them talk about hundreds of lives

516
00:35:01,260 --> 00:35:03,260
as if they were nothing,

517
00:35:05,860 --> 00:35:07,940
as if they were a problem to be avoided.

518
00:35:08,980 --> 00:35:09,760
I felt

519
00:35:12,980 --> 00:35:14,000
that the world was over.

520
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:16,599
But brother,

521
00:35:19,039 --> 00:35:20,099
there is a group of people

522
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:24,380
that makes me see another possibility.

523
00:35:25,559 --> 00:35:26,900
Is your ideal

524
00:35:29,139 --> 00:35:29,800
to work

525
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:31,139
with such a group of people

526
00:35:32,539 --> 00:35:33,739
side by side?

527
00:35:50,199 --> 00:35:51,059
Doctor Xie,

528
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:53,139
how is the child?

529
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,920
He has a slight fever.

530
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,079
He needs physical cooling.

531
00:35:56,579 --> 00:35:58,239
Go make a bowl of scallion soup,

532
00:35:58,300 --> 00:35:59,679
and bring some strong liquor

533
00:35:59,679 --> 00:36:01,019
to wipe his body.

534
00:36:01,380 --> 00:36:01,980
Yes.

535
00:36:02,019 --> 00:36:02,579
Go.

536
00:36:07,139 --> 00:36:08,019
Doctor Xie,

537
00:36:09,199 --> 00:36:10,699
Did you send the letter?

538
00:36:11,199 --> 00:36:12,400
I asked someone to send it

539
00:36:12,519 --> 00:36:14,079
to the mansion of Nan Huaiyu.

540
00:36:14,639 --> 00:36:15,380
He's sure

541
00:36:15,460 --> 00:36:17,000
that it was delivered to the butler.

542
00:36:17,239 --> 00:36:18,019
But

543
00:36:18,420 --> 00:36:19,960
it's been several days,

544
00:36:20,679 --> 00:36:22,179
and there's no reply.

545
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:25,880
It's like it was swallowed by the sea.

546
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,880
That's impossible.

547
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,679
When Changxuan sees the letter,

548
00:36:34,780 --> 00:36:36,679
he will come to save me.

549
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:43,900
Dr. Xie,

550
00:36:44,900 --> 00:36:46,059
I invited you here

551
00:36:46,519 --> 00:36:47,800
to treat the patient,

552
00:36:48,739 --> 00:36:50,739
not to be a mailman.

553
00:36:52,639 --> 00:36:53,460
Jiang Xueting,

554
00:36:54,300 --> 00:36:55,579
I asked her to deliver the letter.

555
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:57,019
Don't kill the innocent.

556
00:37:04,519 --> 00:37:05,780
You're fired.

557
00:37:06,599 --> 00:37:07,199
Get out.

558
00:37:24,099 --> 00:37:24,920
Pingjun,

559
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:26,780
so,

560
00:37:27,980 --> 00:37:29,260
your obedience during this period

561
00:37:29,260 --> 00:37:30,960
was all an act, right?

562
00:37:32,079 --> 00:37:33,940
You compromised

563
00:37:34,059 --> 00:37:35,340
for that bastard.

564
00:37:36,739 --> 00:37:38,599
Why ask if you already know?

565
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:44,940
You've always wondered

566
00:37:44,940 --> 00:37:46,320
why Yu Changxuan

567
00:37:46,639 --> 00:37:47,300
got the letter

568
00:37:47,300 --> 00:37:48,579
but didn't come to save you, right?

569
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:51,880
I can tell you.

570
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,579
You'll know after you see this.

571
00:38:08,019 --> 00:38:09,639
Back then, the commander and his wife

572
00:38:09,719 --> 00:38:11,679
wanted to arrange a marriage between

573
00:38:11,679 --> 00:38:13,719
Miss Jun and the fifth young master.

574
00:38:14,139 --> 00:38:15,800
From family background to appearance,

575
00:38:16,139 --> 00:38:16,820
they are

576
00:38:16,820 --> 00:38:18,059
a perfect match.

577
00:38:19,500 --> 00:38:20,219
Impossible.

578
00:38:21,059 --> 00:38:22,059
This is impossible.

579
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,179
This is absolutely impossible.

580
00:38:26,460 --> 00:38:27,239
Pingjun,

581
00:38:28,300 --> 00:38:29,780
you're too naive.

582
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:31,880
Do you know

583
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,019
the Jun family's background?

584
00:38:34,380 --> 00:38:35,500
Her uncle

585
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,260
is the envoy to the US.

586
00:38:38,380 --> 00:38:39,019
Her father

587
00:38:39,019 --> 00:38:40,699
is a famous Chinese pastor.

588
00:38:41,639 --> 00:38:43,179
They can control

589
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:45,340
all the military supplies and loans

590
00:38:45,340 --> 00:38:47,619
that the southern government wants from the US.

591
